---
---

<section class="bg-fog px-6 py-16 lg:px-[62px]">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <img
        src="/img/Foto-VillaBobosOfficePark10.jpg"
        alt=""
        width="405"
        height="623"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-1 bg-mist px-6 py-6"
          data-reveal="zoomIn"
          data-reveal-delay="500"
        >
          <span class="font-sans text-base text-graytext">Salas de Auditórios</span>
          <span
            class="font-sans text-5xl font-semibold text-slate"
            data-contador="3"
            data-contador-duracao="2000">0</span
          >
        </div>
        <img
          src="/img/Foto-VillaBobosOfficePark16-1536x800.jpg"
          alt=""
          width="405"
          height="211"
          class="h-[211px] w-full object-cover"
        />
        <img
          src="/img/Foto-VillaBobosOfficePark9-1536x800.jpg"
          alt=""
          width="405"
          height="211"
          class="h-[211px] w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-5">
      <span class="font-sans text-xl leading-5 font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-sand">
        NOSSOS EVENTOS
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-sans text-[35px] leading-[35px] font-semibold tracking-[1.5px] text-steel">
        CONFIRA A PROGRAMAÇÃO
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-xl leading-[30px] tracking-[0.5px] text-graytext">
        Todos os auditórios e salas estão disponíveis para locação tanto para as empresas
        residentes em nosso condomínio quanto para o público externo.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/calendario"
        data-reveal="fadeInUp"
        data-reveal-delay="500"
        class="font-sans text-base text-ink">« Todos Eventos</a
      >
      <a
        href="/salas-auditorios"
        data-reveal="fadeInUp"
        data-reveal-delay="600"
        class="w-fit rounded-lg bg-mint px-6 py-3 font-sans text-xl leading-5 tracking-[0.5px] text-white"
      >
        VER SALAS DISPONÍVEIS
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
